 "descriptive_reading_not_in_the_gate": {
  "what_the_escaped_passes_are": "of the 120 production argument passes that the escape rule drops with the caller doing nothing afterwards: 45 go to EXTERNAL callees (21 families), 44 are depth-1 FORWARDS inside first-party callees (mostly into constructors: Marten BatchExecution / CommandExecution x17, RepoDB type-coercing readers, DbInterpreter.GetDbVersion), 10 BORROW (read by hand above), 9 ADOPT (Marten session constructors storing IConnectionLifetime / MartenDatabase / ProjectionUpdateBatch, an exception transformer recording an NpgsqlBatch, ExplainQueryAsync storing the command), 9 UNUSED (parameters the cheap body-proof does not see used, mostly handed to base constructors through `: base(x)` which the proof does not follow) and 3 ALIAS_TO_RESULT (MemoryStream / BinaryReader wrapped into the result)",
  "external_exposure_of_the_conservative_default": "the 45 external passes by callee: Weasel IGroupedParameterBuilder.AppendParameter x11 (a PooledList stored by the builder: adopt), ImTools.ImHashMap.AddOrUpdate x7 (MartenDatabase stored in a map: adopt), HttpClient.PostAsync x6 (ByteArrayContent / StringContent: the callee disposes the content after sending: release), StreamWriter constructor x3 (a stream wrapped: alias / adopt), List<OracleParameter>.Add x2 and List<DbCommand>.Add (adopt), Marten session-logger hooks x3 (NpgsqlBatch: borrow), Migrator.WriteScript (borrow) and single others; under the conservative default WITHOUT callee effects every one of them becomes a finding, and by inspection the large families are adopt or release, i.e. false positives; the effects such a default would need first: collection Add / AddOrUpdate (ADOPT), HttpClient.PostAsync / SendAsync content (RELEASE), stream wrapper constructors (ALIAS / ADOPT)",
  "balance": "1 formal, benign, author-suppressed true positive against roughly 110 sites (45 external + 44 forwards + 9 adopt + 9 unused + 3 alias) that would each need a proven callee effect before the conservative default could be turned on without false positives on this population: on these eight consumers an owned local handed to a callee with nothing done afterwards is overwhelmingly a transfer (adopt / forward into a constructor / release by the callee), not a borrow",
